// The player's side of the charge routines, to be PLAYED
// (`FERAL_DEV_ARENA=1 cargo run`, main menu [R], [L] this file, [F]).
// The headless bin cannot measure it: the party plays All-Attack and never
// invokes a routine, so `routine` changes nothing it reports. Here the
// player starts with Long Compile and walks the wind-up by hand — [s] to
// begin, then [H] hold or [X] release on each later turn, while the pack
// closes in. Stand still too long and a sub_process's Haymaker lands first.
(
    player: Fresh(level: 8, zone: 3),
    character: (routine: Some("long_compile")),
    opponents: [(species: "sub_process", count: 3)],
    model: Tactical,
    approach: Some(East),
    reps: 1,
    seed: 3,
)
